	prov:wasDerivedFrom au:evidence-manner-3-9 .
au:act-mail-letter uco-action:performer au:person-augustine ; uco-action:instrument au:inst-usps ; uco-action:object au:consumers .
au:act-email-phone uco-action:performer au:person-augustine ; uco-action:instrument au:email , au:phone .
au:investigation a case-investigation:Investigation ;
